{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05159","headline":"陪张燕公行郡竹篱 · 赵冬曦","name":"陪张燕公行郡竹篱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良臣乃国宝，麾守去承明。\n外户人无闭，浮江兽已行。\n随来晋盗逸，民化蜀风清。\n郛郭从彝典，州闾荷德声。\n小人投天涯，流落巴丘城。\n所赖中和作，优游凿与耕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵冬曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}